						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: ANTI ALIASING\n\nIn this example we've made the inlets for Antialiasing visible.\nAntialiasing helps you to create smooth and feathered edges.\nTry playing with the AA Direction and amount to see the results."
