					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 3: CAMERA\n\nIn this example we've revealed the camera inlet and added a Camera2D node.\nThe camera will zoom and pan around your shape.\nThis is not the same as transforming\/moving this shape.\nInstead of transforming the shape, you are moving the viewport."
